          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eaweedida gajeajaat gheang'da eenda aba badayda gheeh Dawdi ea dea fuga mida Yerusalemu eamiidu saawa aba riing'eeda ea ririnnyeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak eaweedida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega gaydasach gheawunga aseecheeka aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. Ak ea majeapkaat ak gaydahoan sibanga ea gurooruunatka munyas bea ririnnyeanda, gwariteawa jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas gwardu giliwas sih ak gwahinda geaw sibaneeda. Abeeda gaygwayeesha ghwaan ea ghaamwat niny, ‘Majabiidana badayda ng'eanyiida, aba gideaba girgu ng'asheega ng'uyeega aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA.’ Ak aba damandida rukuna ramoorangean gayghang'ut ghwaan ea ghaamwat aba barda ak ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda eaweedida gilinyoo ea sibaneeda gil. Gayghabwaspwas aba gili itaanyi siihiimsean iramoaran, ak ea maygookwa hang'da mideawa buudeega, aba gideaba gwareengani buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaghus gwayi, ‘Aniini meawoosi sibaneeda earahay, aniini geawooschi siida bara ng'eanyi, nea gutawoos baleanda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas geepearsa gideaba ‘deaneaduutsu gabwa naaha?’ Gaygwayi, ‘Deaneaduutsu ghaanyaschi aba gheeda siida eaduupcheewi.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diigheanda jea eabwara jeagiischoocheanda ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
